{
  "uid": "ticket-resiliencia",
  "title": "Resiliencia",
  "description": "As defesas em acao: o circuito que para de chamar um vizinho doente, o retry que atravessa uma falha passageira do provedor de pagamento e o limite de requisicoes do gateway. E o painel que se abre durante a demonstracao de queda.",
  "tags": ["ticket-platform", "resilience4j"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": { "from": "now-15m", "to": "now" },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Circuito agora",
      "description": "O Resilience4j publica um gauge por estado possivel, valendo 1 apenas no estado corrente. A expressao colapsa isso num numero unico — 0 fechado, 1 meio aberto, 2 aberto — porque um painel com quatro series binarias e ilegivel de relance.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (name) (resilience4j_circuitbreaker_state{state=\"open\"}) * 2 + sum by (name) (resilience4j_circuitbreaker_state{state=\"half_open\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{name}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "orientation": "vertical"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": { "text": "FECHADO", "color": "green", "index": 0 },
                "1": { "text": "MEIO ABERTO", "color": "orange", "index": 1 },
                "2": { "text": "ABERTO", "color": "red", "index": 2 }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "text", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "Estado dos circuit breakers ao longo do tempo",
      "description": "A faixa vermelha e o intervalo em que o booking-service parou de chamar o event-service. A laranja curta logo depois e o meio aberto: as chamadas de teste que decidem se o vizinho voltou.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 18, "x": 6, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (name) (resilience4j_circuitbreaker_state{state=\"open\"}) * 2 + sum by (name) (resilience4j_circuitbreaker_state{state=\"half_open\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{name}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showValue": "never",
        "mergeValues": true,
        "alignValue": "center",
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": { "text": "fechado", "color": "green", "index": 0 },
                "1": { "text": "meio aberto", "color": "orange", "index": 1 },
                "2": { "text": "aberto", "color": "red", "index": 2 }
              }
            }
          ],
          "custom": { "lineWidth": 0, "fillOpacity": 80 },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "text", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Chamadas ao event-service, por desfecho",
      "description": "As 'recusadas pelo circuito' sao o ponto todo do circuit breaker: chamadas que nem chegaram a sair pelo fio. Elas so aparecem depois que o circuito abre, e e quando elas sobem que o event-service para de receber carga de um servico que ja sabia que ele estava fora.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (kind) (rate(resilience4j_circuitbreaker_calls_seconds_count{name=\"event-service\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{kind}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum(rate(resilience4j_circuitbreaker_not_permitted_calls_total{name=\"event-service\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "recusadas pelo circuito"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 20, "showPoints": "never", "stacking": { "mode": "normal" } }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "recusadas pelo circuito" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "successful" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "green" } }]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Taxa de falha medida pelo circuito",
      "description": "O numero que o proprio circuito usa para decidir. A linha tracejada e o limiar configurado (50%); quando a taxa a cruza com a janela minima preenchida, o circuito abre. Vale -1 enquanto nao houve chamadas suficientes para uma decisao — deliberadamente, para nao confundir 'nao sei ainda' com '0% de falha'.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 6 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "resilience4j_circuitbreaker_failure_rate",
          "legendFormat": "{{name}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": -1,
          "max": 100,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "dashed" }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 50 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Pagamentos salvos pelo retry",
      "description": "Cobrancas que falharam na primeira tentativa e passaram numa repeticao, na ultima hora. E a justificativa do retry existir traduzida em vendas que teriam sido perdidas sem ele.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(resilience4j_retry_calls_total{name=\"pagamento\",kind=\"successful_with_retry\"}[1h])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "salvos"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "text", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tentativas de pagamento, por desfecho",
      "description": "O `failed_with_retry` e o unico que deveria preocupar: sao as cobrancas que gastaram as quatro tentativas e ainda assim nao passaram. O `successful_without_retry` e o caminho feliz e domina o grafico em operacao normal.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 10, "x": 6, "y": 14 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (kind) (rate(resilience4j_retry_calls_total{name=\"pagamento\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{kind}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 20, "showPoints": "never", "stacking": { "mode": "normal" } }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requisicoes recusadas pelo gateway (429)",
      "description": "O rate limiter em acao. Zero em uso normal; sobe quando alguem dispara uma rajada — que e exatamente o teste de carga que a plataforma existe para sobreviver.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 14 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=\"api-gateway\",status=\"429\"}[1m])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "recusadas"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "orange" },
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 20, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    }
  ]
}
